## Proposed Database & Schema Changes

### 1. [MODIFY] [schema.sql](file:///c:/Users/manik/Downloads/Email%20Suit/backend/schema.sql)
We will add regional metadata to campaigns, and tracking fields to recipients and events.

*   Add a `target_region` column to the `campaigns` table:
    ```sql
    ALTER TABLE public.campaigns ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS target_region VARCHAR(100) DEFAULT 'US';
    ```
*   Add tracking columns to the `recipients` table:
    ```sql
    ALTER TABLE public.recipients ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS opened_at TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE;
    ALTER TABLE public.recipients ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS clicked_at TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE;
    ALTER TABLE public.recipients ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS open_count INTEGER DEFAULT 0 NOT NULL;
    ALTER TABLE public.recipients ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS click_count INTEGER DEFAULT 0 NOT NULL;
    ```
*   Create a `recipient_events` table to log granular view and click details:
    ```sql
    CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS public.recipient_events (
        id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),
        recipient_id UUID REFERENCES public.recipients(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,
        event_type VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL, -- 'open' | 'click'
        link_url TEXT,
        ip_address VARCHAR(100),
        user_agent TEXT,
        created_at TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE DEFAULT timezone('utc'::text, now()) NOT NULL
    );
    ```

